  "label": "right-wing, gun-owning, anti-establishment, anti-leftist American patriots",
  "description": "The meme is designed to resonate with individuals who identify with or sympathize with right-wing, gun-owning, anti-government, and anti-leftist ideologies. The visual of the man holding an assault rifle in front of an American flag, combined with the text that uses 'commie' to insult a doctor and references 'patriotic' behavior, targets those who embrace or are drawn to the 'patriotic rifleman' stereotype. The use of 'commie' as a slur and the violent imagery are intended to appeal to or provoke members of communities that hold anti-leftist sentiment and support gun rights, often associated with conservative or libertarian political movements.",
